faceunlock (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * PAM module pam_faceunlock.so with hard timeout and fail-open semantics.
  * YuNet 2023mar + SFace 2021dec, OpenCV 4.11 vendored under
    /usr/lib/faceunlock/vendor (noble's OpenCV 4.6 cannot run the v2 model).
  * CLI: doctor / status / users / list / enroll / rename / delete / test /
    enable / disable / panic / threshold / service.
  * polkit-gated privileged helper faceunlock-admin (JSON-Lines).

